    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<div>\n    <table class=\"grid dict\">\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Id: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">TrustDemoDT03</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Url: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><a href=\"PlanDefinition-TrustDemoDT03.html\">TD.DT.03 Does the national schedule count this dose?</a></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Version: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">0.1.0</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Title: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">TD.DT.03 Does the national schedule count this dose?</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Status: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">draft</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Experimental: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">true</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Type: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                \n                    \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>system: </b> <span><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/CodeSystem-plan-definition-type.html\">http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/plan-definition-type</a></span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>code: </b> <span>eca-rule</span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Date: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">2026-11-06 08:51:07+0000</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Publisher: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">litlfred</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Description: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><div><p>For one Immunization in the child's record, decide whether the schedule evaluation counts it as given. Requirements: STD-SCH-001, STD-SEM-001. Hit policy FIRST: the rules are tried in order and the first that matches applies.</p>\n</div></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Related Artifacts: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                \n                <p><b>Documentation</b></p>\n                <ul>\n                    \n                    <li><a href=\"\"> Decision table TD.DT.03 (OMG DMN 1.3): dose-counts.dmn</a></li>\n                    \n                </ul>\n                \n                \n                \n                <p><b>Dependencies</b></p>\n                <ul>\n                    \n                    <li><a href=\"StructureDefinition-TrustDemoLaoImmunization.html\">Lao PDR: dose on the national schedule</a></li>\n                    \n                    <li><a href=\"StructureDefinition-TrustDemoLaoReportedImmunization.html\">Lao PDR: foreign dose as reported (not yet verified)</a></li>\n                    \n                </ul>\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Actions: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 1:</b> <div><p>When primarySource is false: counts = false; why = Reported, not verified. A reported dose (J2: TrustDemoJ2HepBReported) is shown but not counted.</p>\n</div>\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 2:</b> <div><p>When primarySource is true and hasScheduleCode is false: counts = false; why = Unmapped: shown to the clinician. A verified dose with no schedule code (TD.DT.02 unmapped) cannot be read by the schedule, which works on schedule codes.</p>\n</div>\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 3:</b> <div><p>When primarySource is true and hasScheduleCode is true: counts = true; why = Counted as given. STD-SCH-001: counted by its schedule code and date, wherever it was given (J3: TrustDemoJ3HepB, TrustDemoJ3Bcg).</p>\n</div>\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n    </table>\n</div>\n</div>"
